图一用于借书时根据库存情况选择借出或预约；图二用于交卷时根据署名情况选择收卷或补签。

**图一：借书流程**

\begin{circuitikz}[flowchart]
\draw (0,0) node[rectangle]{查书};
\draw (0,-2) node[diamond]{有库存};
\draw (-3,-4) node[rectangle]{借出};
\draw (3,-4) node[rectangle]{预约};
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,-2);
\draw[->] (0,-2) -- (-3,-4) node[midway,above left]{是};
\draw[->] (0,-2) -- (3,-4) node[midway,above right]{否};
\end{circuitikz}

**图二：交卷流程**

\begin{circuitikz}[flowchart]
\draw (0,0) node[rectangle]{验卷};
\draw (0,-2) node[diamond]{已署名};
\draw (-3,-4) node[rectangle]{收卷};
\draw (3,-4) node[rectangle]{补签};
\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,-2);
\draw[->] (0,-2) -- (-3,-4) node[midway,above left]{是};
\draw[->] (0,-2) -- (3,-4) node[midway,above right]{否};
\end{circuitikz}

